su name judge moment be ceremony def
  su name judged out
  ob text of better out
  for name judge
  to name text judged out
  by num 0
  be write do

  su name decision out ob text of judged out be text ya
prah

su name reviewer trying to name text output be ceremony def
  su name task ob text ob of this ya

  su name sketch out
  ob text task
  for name author
  to name text sketch out
  by num 0
  be write do

  su name criticism out
  ob text sketch out
  for name reviewer
  to name text criticism out
  by num 0
  be write do

  su name better out
  ob text criticism out
  for name author
  to name text better out
  by num 0
  be write do

  su name decision out ob text of criticism out be text ya
  ob name judge triggered be equally from text truth then
  be judge moment do

  ob text of decision out be equally from text "PASS" then
  su name better out ret

  su name reviewer defective ob text "reviewer fail" be error ya
  su name reviewer defective ret
prah

su name reviewer circle be refinery def
exists su name reviewer round ob la ob text of task to name text output be reviewer trying do ko be platform ya
prah

exists su name reviewer trying be export ya
exists su name reviewer circle be export ya
exists su name judge moment be export ya
